# Car DNA needs no environment variables.
#
# The San Jose base map, the road network for driving distances, and the EV charging and gas
# station lists are files inside this repository (public/map, public/data) and are built with
# tools/build_local_map.py. Nothing is fetched from a map tile, geocoding, routing or facility
# service while the app runs, so there is no key to configure and no .env file to create.
#
# This file is kept as documentation only.
